	"VersionName": "2.1.1",
	"FriendlyName": "Speech Recognition Plugin",
	"Description": "Offline voice commands for Unreal Engine 5, built on PocketSphinx: keyword spotting, JSGF grammars and language models. A second engine recognises any phrase you can write, in any alphabet: Arabic and its dialects, Tunisian Darija included, or invented words, with a speech model run on the Neural Network Engine. No dictionary, no training, no cloud service, no GPU.",
	"Category": "Audio",
	"CreatedBy": "Shane Colbert; UE5 port by Urszula Kustra; fixes and extensions by Khalil Ben Gaied",
	"CreatedByURL": "https://github.com/KhalilBenGaied66",
